{"vid": 340791361, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 15, "reviews": [{"range": "12721-12755", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 2, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "426066534_8beqPeAx0", "review": {"abstract": "可以使其向上的因素有：美元相对于欧元升值，或者美国通胀程度高于欧盟。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "chapterUid": 15, "content": "美元对欧盟的实际购买力 ∝ 名义汇率（美元/欧元） × (欧盟物价 / 美国物价)。\n1美元升值\n2美国通胀，假设汇率不变，1美元在国内只能买1个面包，但换成1欧元却能买10个面包，所以美元相对于欧元购买力强了", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "12721-12755", "createTime": 1786278385, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 15, "reviewId": "426066534_8beqPeAx0", "userVid": 426066534, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}}, "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": []}, {"reviewId": "3183165_89IWhdFpC", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 15, "content": "内在逻辑：美元升值预期下，如果美国通胀又显著的高，那么美元走强的可能性比较模糊，如果美国通胀不会显著抬升，那么美元走强的可能性就很大。", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "可以使其向上的因素有：美元相对于欧元升值，或者美国通胀程度高于欧盟。", "range": "12721-12755", "chapterName": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "chapterIdx": 15, "reviewId": "3183165_89IWhdFpC", "userVid": 3183165, "topics": [], "createTime": 1780967976, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "author": {"userVid": 3183165, "name": "Chan", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/0Lx53tbXl5m4uHibjMfo7AvyxJ11bIniabI8xOa7qwf5SiaYGcjENQQL7xkeGEpAMW5TcMVqzCExZN7B96QFyYcnF6xd1iaohgZdjeicZ4RaVo4E/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-1000", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 1}]}, {"range": "12952-13001", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 6, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "253680463_88H2ixyui", "review": {"abstract": "美元被低估来自QE之后通胀预期下催生的弱势美元，但实际上，美国未来两三年通胀是可控的。美联储放出去的钱是可以收回的，这一点和我们国家有巨大的不同。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "chapterUid": 15, "content": "主要指流动性创造机制的差异：\n美国的模式（市场主导）：美联储的QE主要是向金融市场购买国债和抵押支持证券（MBS），钱首先流入银行体系，再由银行根据市场风险和盈利机会放贷出去。这个链条的最后一环是市场化的。如果银行惜贷，或实体经济没有借贷意愿，资金就会淤积在金融体系内部（体现为银行准备金增加），而不会立刻涌向商品和服务以全面推高通胀。美联储收回流动性的操作主要在金融层面，链条相对直接，对实体经济融资环境的传导很快（通过资本市场）。\n中国等后发国家的常见模式（银行驱动）：信用创造高度依赖银行体系贷款。刺激经济的钱往往直接通过指令或窗口指导流向基建、国企和制造业投资，资金直接进入实体经济，推动实物需求和物价，推升的往往是商品和服务的直接通胀。这个链条决定了，一旦放水，就变成了实体领域的产能和价格问题，想收回时，面对的是已经上马的项目和复杂的三角债务，收回的难度和社会成本都极大。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 0, "range": "12928-13001", "createTime": 1777338278, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 15, "reviewId": "253680463_88H2ixyui", "userVid": 253680463, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "author": {"userVid": 253680463, "name": "那の小娜", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTJJI1JrTyvrQL5ibJL2bgKia3zSm7g2qUnKzfiavnXVRSvRF5z6m9Mgicbyp81qe009GUWkhibTfA5gfuA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-1000", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 5}, {"reviewId": "254854030_880V55zmK", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 15, "content": "美国QE是央行主动买债创造货币，经济好转时可以卖出债券直接收回流动性，收紧货币、推高美元、控制通胀，操作完全自主。而中国当时基础货币主要是企业和外贸赚回美元，央行被迫用人民币兑换：外汇进来多少，人民币就被动发多少，很难主动收缩，一旦外汇流入减少或流出，国内流动性容易被动收紧或扩张。央行不像美联储那样可以自由通过卖债回收货币，货币投放和收回的主动权不在自己手里，而是被动依赖外汇收支。\n2014年之前外汇占款是基础货币的绝对主力，企业出口、外资进来，央行必须买入外汇、被动投放人民币，投放多少完全看外汇流入，央行几乎没法主动收缩。2015年后外汇占款规模稳定甚至下降，央行转向用MLF、PSL、再贷款、逆回购等工具主动借钱给银行来投放基础货币，投放节奏、规模、期限都由央行根据国内经济、通胀、流动性自主决定，想收的时候可以到期不续或反向操作收回，和美联储主动买/卖债调控流动性的逻辑越来越像。到2026年央行资产里外汇占款占比约47%，对银行债权占比约40%，两者接近，但新增基础货币主要来自央行主动工具，外汇占款更多是存量稳定、偶尔阶段性影响增量，不再是被动主导的状态。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "但实际上，美国未来两三年通胀是可控的。美联储放出去的钱是可以收回的，这一点和我们国家有巨大的不同。", "range": "12952-13001", "chapterName": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "chapterIdx": 15, "reviewId": "254854030_880V55zmK", "userVid": 254854030, "topics": [], "createTime": 1774946057, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, "likesCount": 35}, {"reviewId": "276023870_87fT6Pi3q", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "在中国主要是把钱给到商业银行，然后**通过银行贷款，把钱实打实地贷给实体经济**。在中国，这些钱大量流向了哪里？**房地产（盖楼）、地方政府城投平台（修桥、修路、建高铁）、国有企业（搞大基建）**。\n*   **为什么难收回？** 这就是巨大的不同！美国美联储手里拿着的是随时可以卖掉的债券，但**中国放出去的钱，变成了钢筋水泥、变成了修了一半的高速公路、变成了还没交房的楼盘。**\n    *   如果中国央行想要强行把水“抽回来”（强制银行收回贷款），会发生什么？\n    *   修了一半的桥会停工，房地产商拿不出卖房款会烂尾破产，地方政府还不上债会违约。\n*   **特点：** 中国的钱一旦放出去，很多就变成了“沉没成本”或者缺乏流动性的实物资产，紧紧绑在了实体经济上。**易放难收**。就像用水泥浇筑了一栋楼，你想再把水泥里的水原封不动地抽回来，楼就塌了。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "12953-13001", "abstract": "实际上，美国未来两三年通胀是可控的。美联储放出去的钱是可以收回的，这一点和我们国家有巨大的不同。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 15, "chapterName": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "chapterIdx": 15, "reviewId": "276023870_87fT6Pi3q", "userVid": 276023870, "topics": [], "createTime": 1772274639, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "author": {"userVid": 276023870, "name": "耕心若溪", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEJibQhvqnuGLLR8pAkWtibbs16LcLIwhz4klZ22YTLalWl20NvBS4AwmK7iaALL72OLCg7S6OaFfGtVArwaLsrvPq8OMoSHX7sPVriaqsSdOwndCg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "耕心若溪", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M12-0-0-B-6-6-1", "desc": "世界读书日", "title": "世界读书日", "levelIndex": 0}}}, "likesCount": 13, "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": []}, {"reviewId": "3126459_80Ceax4T4", "review": {"abstract": "美联储放出去的钱是可以收回的，这一点和我们国家有巨大的不同。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "chapterUid": 15, "content": "我们的形成了固定资产投资，美国仍在资本市场内，变现回收能力更强", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "12971-13001", "createTime": 1748892235, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "3126459_80Ceax4T4", "userVid": 3126459, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 15, "chapterTitle": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "author": {"userVid": 3126459, "name": "firstprinciple", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/XYrRG5UShDd1OS4NmWmYVvGiahSoB8vicj5rBuDzEmgHdlDvOsl7jtCScOZuryFyyUSvvBSiaqaEak/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "firstprinciple", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-1000", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 3}, {"reviewId": "426066534_8beqcXcao", "review": {"abstract": "但实际上，美国未来两三年通胀是可控的。美联储放出去的钱是可以收回的，这一点和我们国家有巨大的不同。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "chapterUid": 15, "content": "中国也要发展大金融", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "12952-13001", "createTime": 1786277819, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 15, "reviewId": "426066534_8beqcXcao", "userVid": 426066534, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}}, "likesCount": 0}, {"reviewId": "11753586_89HBGNK90", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "• 美元体系：央行通过买卖国债投放/回收货币。购债放水，债券到期停购即可等额收回，流程闭环、操作灵活。\n• 传统人民币体系：依托外汇结汇发行货币。结汇释放的人民币大量沉淀于实体经济，难以原路收回，仅能通过冻结资金等手段临时调节。\n• 现阶段国内货币投放逐步转向债券、借贷工具，回笼能力提升，但和美元体系仍存在差异。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "12928-13099", "abstract": "美元被低估来自QE之后通胀预期下催生的弱势美元，但实际上，美国未来两三年通胀是可控的。美联储放出去的钱是可以收回的，这一点和我们国家有巨大的不同。", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 15, "chapterName": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "chapterIdx": 15, "reviewId": "11753586_89HBGNK90", "userVid": 11753586, "topics": [], "createTime": 1780892315, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "author": {"userVid": 11753586, "name": "Gordon", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTJfCGhafJlibLBtiaGcy3MX72WLwGrLGxiakibRiafib9FIall2S2nxo8icHZApSYDdWUCfrXgt24oSKwicGg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "Gordon", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}}, "likesCount": 2, "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": []}]}, {"range": "13652-13703", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 1, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "254854030_881WMjSRF", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 15, "content": "在欧元区决议使用欧元之前并不存在真正流通的欧元，当时的欧元其实是欧洲货币单位（ECU，埃居），它只是一个由欧共体成员国货币按权重组成的记账单位/货币篮子，不是可以日常使用的现金货币，也没有任何国家把它当作法定货币流通。ECU的价值由德国马克、法国法郎、英镑、意大利里拉等一篮子货币加权决定，主要用于欧共体内部的官方结算、金融交易计价，普通民众日常还是用各自国家的货币。\n早期英镑和欧洲货币单位相对于美元走势基本一致的原因是当时英国加入了欧洲汇率机制（ERM），英镑必须盯住德国马克，且汇率波动被严格限制在很小区间内，而ECU本身就是以德国马克为核心的货币篮子，所以英镑和ECU对美元的波动方向、幅度高度趋同。但1992年《马斯特里赫特条约》确定了欧元的未来，更关键的是同年爆发欧洲汇率机制危机，英国因经济基本面与德国不匹配、无法承受德国高利率政策，在索罗斯等投机力量冲击下，英镑被迫退出 ERM不再盯住德国马克。此后英镑回归自由浮动，货币政策完全独立，而 ECU（后来的欧元）则继续沿着欧洲一体化路径，由欧洲央行主导、锚定德国马克的稳定逻辑发展，两者的汇率决定机制、货币政策目标彻底分化。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "1992年，欧元被在马斯特里赫特签订的《欧洲联盟条约》确定。从此，欧元与英镑相对于美元的走势不再一致。", "range": "13652-13703", "chapterName": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "chapterIdx": 15, "reviewId": "254854030_881WMjSRF", "userVid": 254854030, "topics": [], "createTime": 1775004412, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, "likesCount": 3}]}, {"range": "14147-14193", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 1, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "254854030_881Yk9JER", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 15, "content": "1. 各国经济周期不同步，有的国家通胀高需要加息，有的国家衰退严重需要降息，目标冲突很难达成统一意见。\n2. 欧元区涉及十几个主权国家，各自有政府、议会、利益集团，任何货币政策调整都要协商、妥协、审批，决策机制复杂流程非常繁琐。\n3. 欧洲央行更侧重稳定通胀，本身就偏向保守谨慎，不像美联储可以由主席团队快速决策，因此行动总是更滞后更慢。\n\n如1992年前后德国因为两德统一出现通胀压力坚决要加息，而英国、意大利经济已经衰退急需降息。但因为统一汇率机制不能自行降息，只能硬扛，最终英国撑不住退出欧洲汇率机制，英镑大幅贬值，这就是经济不同步和决策无法快速调整的直接后果。再比如后来欧债危机期间，希腊、西班牙等国急需宽松刺激，但德国坚持抗通胀紧缩导致欧洲央行迟迟不敢大幅放水，救助和货币政策都明显慢于美国，也是因为多国协调成本太高、无法快速统一行动。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "第一，很多国家凑在一起之后，由于各国情况不同，由于更加烦琐的议事日程，货币政策调整更加缓慢。", "range": "14147-14193", "chapterName": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "chapterIdx": 15, "reviewId": "254854030_881Yk9JER", "userVid": 254854030, "topics": [], "createTime": 1775005828, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, "likesCount": 2, "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": []}]}, {"range": "14603-14621", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 4, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "312219939_8aDzNzxE5", "review": {"abstract": "欧猪五国", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "chapterUid": 15, "content": "“欧猪五国”是国际媒体对葡萄牙、意大利、爱尔兰、希腊、西班牙的贬称，因五国英文首字母拼成“PIIGS”像“猪”而得名。它们因债务高、赤字大、产业空心化，在2009年后相继爆发主权债务危机，成为欧元区经济不稳定的焦点。", "contextAbstract": "只是有先有后。比如“欧猪五国”先变坏，然后是意大", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "14606-14610", "createTime": 1784184997, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 15, "reviewId": "312219939_8aDzNzxE5", "userVid": 312219939, "topics": [], "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "author": {"userVid": 312219939, "name": "BeN+", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTIJX2NiaUZKgic1mic05viamTaO9BVebWecBmarBAeTgk0vBOK2pmzcUicziayxB63GoJiauLj5VsoBHTYIQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "BeN+", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M1-0-30", "desc": "连续阅读", "title": "连续阅读", "levelIndex": 30}}}, "likesCount": 4, "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": []}, {"reviewId": "327586801_84BjbiSeK", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 15, "content": "笑死", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "欧猪五国", "range": "14606-14610", "chapterName": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "chapterIdx": 15, "reviewId": "327586801_84BjbiSeK", "userVid": 327586801, "topics": [], "createTime": 1762926485, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "author": {"userVid": 327586801, "name": "徐果果", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/EpnHk9PIovjCX0Iux5VYXxwaefPxib7neEQ2KIkbQc62yav4OKZ7Ng2sK8rWNAruHHekeW6AYFVSjc3S512WmavIhM7NgibqjoIGF0lkicA0fQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-200", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 200}}}, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "22207169_89Rquwhfe", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "意大利应该也在欧猪五国里吧？", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "14603-14621", "abstract": "比如“欧猪五国”先变坏，然后是意大利", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 15, "chapterName": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "chapterIdx": 15, "reviewId": "22207169_89Rquwhfe", "userVid": 22207169, "topics": [], "createTime": 1781450059, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "author": {"userVid": 22207169, "name": "王博博", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/ibd0JMiccwbIrDxYlXb6mPibEacs2ibACIDUNjMictqx6pwaxxZFaK0Tm6zMJk53vniaxU6AicSgUjbNqk8tRoYxJQ7oVy3oEDcy1lfpkoM5xQibHps/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-2000", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 2000}}}, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "224905196_81vkg2yEz", "review": {"abstract": "“欧猪五国", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "chapterUid": 15, "content": "“欧猪五国”（PIIGS）是一个经济金融领域的贬义术语，指代欧洲五个曾面临严重债务危机和经济困境的国家：葡萄牙（Portugal）、意大利（Italy）、爱尔兰（Ireland）、希腊（Greece）和西班牙（Spain）。这一称呼源于这些国家英文名称的首字母组合“PIIGS”，与英文单词“pigs”（猪）相似，带有一定的侮辱性，因此财经界普遍忌讳使用。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "14605-14610", "createTime": 1752021826, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "224905196_81vkg2yEz", "userVid": 224905196, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 15, "chapterTitle": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "author": {"userVid": 224905196, "name": "刘荣", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/OjAhVbNreZxjBnYiaGiajsTtZDjiagqXiazgcN93ulgGOQFR4oCn20x9FaPfCb1RPhLN7Hq0WYn3ukWCAIZsfibhzbA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "奔赴一万小时", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-100", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作发烧友", "levelIndex": 100}}}, "likesCount": 14, "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": []}]}, {"range": "15369-15421", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 1, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "254854030_88226KXBT", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 15, "content": "因为决定货币长期汇率的根本是货币超发程度（M2增速）与经济基本面而不是决策快慢。欧元只是决策慢、反应迟钝、跌得晚，但欧元区和英国的货币宽松程度、通胀压力、经济周期本质是接近的。英镑跌到位之后欧元早晚也要补上同样幅度的下跌，只是滞后几年，长期来看下跌幅度最终基本一样。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "不管是以上哪个原因，都使得欧元相对于美元的调整更慢。但随着真实情况的暴露，最终的调整幅度会与英镑基本相同", "range": "15369-15421", "chapterName": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "chapterIdx": 15, "reviewId": "254854030_88226KXBT", "userVid": 254854030, "topics": [], "createTime": 1775009294, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, "likesCount": 5}]}, {"range": "15605-15645", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 1, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "426066534_8berPAgBP", "review": {"abstract": "而如果欧元与英镑走势重合，那么欧元将在未来下跌20%以上，从而推动美元指数破百。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "chapterUid": 15, "content": "人才啊，提供一个角度，可以以英镑看欧元", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "15605-15645", "createTime": 1786279306, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 15, "reviewId": "426066534_8berPAgBP", "userVid": 426066534, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}}}]}, {"range": "15790-15837", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 1, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "374254315_8dcgt1U94", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "站在当下2026年10月底来看，近一年以来，人民币升值越来越快。那么，人民币升值对我国的影响，是否也同样适用这两点呢——J曲线效应，吸引资本流入", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "15790-15837", "abstract": "从两年的时间长度看，美元升值对美国有利无害。有两点原因：第一，J曲线效应；第二，吸引资本流入。", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 15, "chapterName": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "chapterIdx": 15, "reviewId": "374254315_8dcgt1U94", "userVid": 374254315, "topics": [], "createTime": 1793198524, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "author": {"userVid": 374254315, "name": "冉冉上升", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0004-PdaEmjDnice28eeFAN2QNc5/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "冉冉上升", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "读书、运动、烘焙", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "是否仍在守护心灵的纯粹与真诚？", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}]}, {"range": "15935-15939", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 1, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "254854030_882323Xr9", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 15, "content": "经常账户 ≈ 一国实体层面的对外收支账户\n包括：\n1. 货物贸易（出口、进口，最主要部分）\n2. 服务贸易（旅游、运输、金融服务）\n3. 投资收益（利息、股息）\n4. 转移支付（援助、侨汇）\n\n和它对应的是资本与金融账户（资本账户）：\n1. 买股票、买债券、直接投资、热钱流动\n2. 纯金融行为，不对应实物买卖", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "经常账户", "range": "15935-15939", "chapterName": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "chapterIdx": 15, "reviewId": "254854030_882323Xr9", "userVid": 254854030, "topics": [], "createTime": 1775010141, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, "likesCount": 1}]}, {"range": "16287-16293", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 1, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "61293073_87fUIIGqB", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "经常项目差额是一国在一定时期内商品、服务、收入和经常转移项目的贷方总额与借方总额的净差额。若贷方大于借方，出现顺差，表示本国对外净投资增加；反之则为逆差，意味着本国运用了外国资源。它是衡量一国长期国际收支状况的重要指标。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "16287-16293", "abstract": "经常项目差额", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 15, "chapterName": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "chapterIdx": 15, "reviewId": "61293073_87fUIIGqB", "userVid": 61293073, "topics": [], "createTime": 1772276115, "contextAbstract": "　美元升值后的两年内经常项目差额没有明显", "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "author": {"userVid": 61293073, "name": "转债量化实盘", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0021-8~KEXhxujimPVVY~plRSYf8/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "转债量化实盘", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "十年程序猿，在搞量化", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "转债量化实盘", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20241104-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, "likesCount": 2}]}, {"range": "16393-16435", "bookMarkCount": 90, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 5, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "13201637_8auKcU7eF", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "小周期三年左右 大周期10/15年", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "16393-16435", "abstract": "但长期升值会损害工业竞争力，所以升值过程一般不会过长，因为升值本身会减弱升值的基础。", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 15, "chapterName": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "chapterIdx": 15, "reviewId": "13201637_8auKcU7eF", "userVid": 13201637, "topics": [], "createTime": 1783683330, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "author": {"userVid": 13201637, "name": "涛仔", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0020-W7534ZFmgUg7mpr8fHPeHe6/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "涛仔", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "愚者妄顺，智者求缺。", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M1-0-180", "desc": "连续阅读", "title": "连续阅读", "levelIndex": 180}}}, "likesCount": 4}, {"reviewId": "20300286_87RsDRhCJ", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 15, "content": "本国货币升值会损害工业竞争力，主要是因为升值使出口商品在国际市场上价格上升，降低需求，同时进口商品变得更便宜，加剧国内竞争。长期升值会导致贸易逆差扩大、经济增长放缓，从而削弱货币进一步升值的基础，因此升值过程通常不会持续过长，市场机制会自我纠正。\n具体来说，货币升值直接影响出口导向的工业。当本国货币升值时，以外币计价的出口商品价格提高，外国买家可能转向更便宜的替代品，导致出口减少。例如，如果人民币升值，中国制造的电子产品在国际市场上会更贵，可能失去市场份额。同时，升值使进口原材料和商品成本降低，虽然这能降低部分生产成本，但也让外国产品更容易进入国内市场，挤压本土工业的生存空间。", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "但长期升值会损害工业竞争力，所以升值过程一般不会过长，因为升值本身会减弱升值的基础。", "range": "16393-16435", "chapterName": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "chapterIdx": 15, "reviewId": "20300286_87RsDRhCJ", "userVid": 20300286, "topics": [], "createTime": 1774408800, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "author": {"userVid": 20300286, "name": "小婧", "avatar": "https://thirdwx